nothing more for a living being.{VAR BE01}
That may be the definition of living,
but I don't think that defines life.{VAR BE01}

The experiences of joy and suffering
are a vital part of being alive.{VAR BE01}
Ghetsis gave me the sensation
of being truly alive...{VAR BE01}
What did he mean to accomplish?
That isn't what's important.{VAR BE01}

Pokémon and people live by being
